  (text "FSIN pin floats; \nunused feature for \nsynchronizing vsync\nof multiple sensors"
    (at 82.55 129.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 06d99453-8180-4e39-a84a-59c98b053de4)
  )
  (text "CXT_SEL pin can float;\npulled low internally, \nanyways, it's a feature \nthat we don't need"
    (at 82.55 114.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0c07059f-6482-4a9c-b418-4aacad648414)
  )
  (text "STROBE pin is an output\nnominally for exciting \nexternal light sources.\nWe don't need it; let \nit float."
    (at 208.28 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2ec61e40-3d78-42c6-be30-62285a9902d1)
  )
  (text "i2c_sel[1..0] = 2'b11\nsets i2c addr to 0x35" (at 82.55 118.11 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 42bbbdc7-2f1a-4ec5-960b-9bae36e82fe4)
  )
  (text "The hm0360 has an internal LDO that \ncan supply its DVDD, but the datasheet\ndoesn't say how to enable or disable it.\nThis 0-ohm resistor is here in case the\ninternal LDO is enabled and we need to disconnect\nit from the external LDO."
    (at 129.54 59.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 93dedd1d-4e4f-478c-ac6b-c047c5c4410d)
  )
  (text "METER pin floats; \nsetting can be \nconfigured via i2c"
    (at 82.55 123.19 0)
    (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ef9483a5-78af-42c2-bf8e-60bd7ef69fac)
  )

